{
  "summary": "DCT MCP Server 2026.1.0.0: vocabulary leaks, truncated discovery schema and doc gaps found in prompt-driven testing",
  "description": {
    "type": "doc",
    "version": 1,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "project repo - https://github.com/delphix/dxi-mcp-server , main branch"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Summary"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Prompt-driven testing of DCT MCP Server 2026.1.0.0 (284 test cases, run with Opus against a live DCT) produced 249 Pass, 10 Fail and 25 Blocked. The 10 failures reduce to the issues below. Results and per-row detail are in "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DCT-MCP-Server-2026.1.0.0-Test-Cases.xlsx",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "code"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (Test Cases sheet, \"Actual Result\" and \"Defect Description\" columns). The \"compliance node\" alias gap is tracked separately in APIGW-31432."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Issues to fix (observed on the live server)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "1. Retired terms and mid-word truncation in generated tool text (TC-111, TC-112)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Generated persona tool descriptions and discovery schema text still say bare "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "\"engine\"",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "strong"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " ("
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "engine_id",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "engine_name",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", \"Upload connector to engines\") and "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "\"container\"",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "strong"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " ("
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "GET /data-layouts",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ": \"template/container\" in 3 field descriptions)."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Truncated descriptions cut mid-word and leave "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "\"timef...\"",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "strong"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "\"Ap...\"",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "strong"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " (AppData) in the text."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Fix: run spec prose through "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "to_canonical",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and truncate at a word boundary."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2. Discovery schema is truncated for "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "POST /vdbs/provision_by_snapshot",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "code"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (TC-109)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "discovery get_operation_schema",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " returns "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "schema_truncated: true",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " with "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "$ref_truncated",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " / "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "max_depth_exceeded",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " markers (engines, tags, tasks, virtualization_tasks). Nested request-body objects ("
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "hooks",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "tde_keystore_config_type",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ") show only as "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "object",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " with no sub-fields."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Expected: no truncation marker for the request body."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Fix: raise the depth limit or resolve request-body refs fully, or change the expectation if the cap is intentional (design decision)."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "3. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "appdata-plugin",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "code"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is not translated (TC-113)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "to_canonical('See TimeflowRange and the appdata-plugin docs.')",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " gives "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "TimelineRange",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " but leaves "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "appdata-plugin",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", so \"appdata\" and \"plugin\" still reach the user. "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "vocabulary.txt",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " lines 19-20 deliberately never translate hyphen-joined tokens."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Decision needed: translate this case, or change the test's expectation."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "4. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "@preserve",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "code"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " directive is undocumented (TC-114)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Used at "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "vocabulary.txt:60",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and loaded at "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "vocabulary.py:127",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", but not described in "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "src/dct_mcp_server/config/CLAUDE.md",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " or "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ".claude/rules/vocabulary-editorial-guidelines.md",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "5. README rename table lacks toolsets (TC-021)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The \"Upgrade note: renamed tools and actions (2026.1.0.0)\" table has only Kind / Old name / New name. It does not give the toolsets or say which tool each renamed action belongs to. The proposal doc that had this was deleted in commit b4e9c1b before the squash merge."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "To confirm on a clean 2026.1.0.0 tag first (TC-074, TC-076, TC-081, TC-082)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These failed on a working tree with uncommitted edits to 9 pre-built "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "*_endpoints_tool.py",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "code"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " files, not on a clean tag. On HEAD, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "git grep",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "code"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " finds none of the offending strings, so they may come from the local edits rather than the release."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "TC-074: \"inventory\" in 2 "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "reporting_tool",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " docstrings and \"container\" in 9 other docstrings."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "TC-076: no \"Customer aliases (accept as input, never use in answers):\" line quotes \"timeflow\"."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "TC-081 / TC-082: 4 failing tests (same 4 on Python 3.11 and 3.12), including "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "check_confirmation() got an unexpected keyword argument 'request_body'",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Action: stash local changes, rerun these rows on a clean copy of the tag, then raise a defect only for what still fails."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Possible, not confirmed"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "TC-015: log line "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "No module mapping for tool: diagnostic_tool",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "; "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "diagnostic_tool",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " did not register in "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "continuous_data_admin",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "platform_admin",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "code"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " on some startups. Needs a repro."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Out of scope"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "25 test cases were Blocked by test-environment limits (embedded mode, custom server settings, no DB2/MySQL source or VDB Group on the test DCT). They are not product defects."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Acceptance criteria"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "No retired term or mid-word truncation in generated persona tool text or discovery schema text (rows TC-111, TC-112 pass)."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "TC-109, TC-113, TC-114 and TC-021 pass, or their expectations are updated with a recorded decision."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "TC-074, TC-076, TC-081 and TC-082 pass on a clean checkout of the tag, or each is split into its own ticket."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
